mal" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityRevenueRecognized" scale="0" id="Narr_ftlZgJiZyUCSbqRB4AZaHg">7,494,000</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Bw5QC5McPUa3s352AniCXg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_GWJI_GDVXkqDEu1UVT4TKQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="aeye:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityRevenueRecognizedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_klz2CaOSW0enAHQxRU4-zw">100</ix:nonFraction>%, in revenue from deferred revenue outstanding as of December&#160;31,&#160;2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">We had <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_customer__k-ZmW4j60ave-vVe_ZRRg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_t1HE6PgQYUuRC0Vht50l5A" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="aeye:NumberOfCustomer" scale="0" id="Narr_fwxqo9swcEew6Ph3XLwNew"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_customer__k-ZmW4j60ave-vVe_ZRRg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_h4dLo_qlzESoz123-edNvA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="aeye:NumberOfCustomer" scale="0" id="Narr_gN0LiF2jekq0jSjpwVYA0g">one</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> major customer (including the customer&#8217;s affiliates reflecting multiple contracts and a partnership with the Company) which accounted for approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Bw5QC5McPUa3s352AniCXg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_aeye_MajorCustomerNumberOneMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_5oblXMhXlE6155nYrC8Rrg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" id="Narr_eYSX7hwfzkeRva-uWUGY3A">13</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Bw5QC5McPUa3s352AniCXg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_aeye_MajorCustomerNumberOneMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_hIOw2ZLII0KkaBNtmKuXQg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" id="Narr_FMENm4PdaUaIy-ISptWZoQ">15</ix:nonFraction>% of our revenue in the years ended December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and 2024, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_customer__k-ZmW4j60ave-vVe_ZRRg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_1o_1N0lwiUmA1QdUJwZGuA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="aeye:NumberOfCustomer" scale="0" id="Narr_85NxBGQ0jE-OmsnrNaTjiQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_customer__k-ZmW4j60ave-vVe_ZRRg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_x3H5qnMC6EC8x2G7h4xrBA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="aeye:NumberOfCustomer" scale="0" id="Narr_kUbZT05McUq9DjqbL9J_3g">One</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> customer represented <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Bw5QC5McPUa3s352AniCXg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_aeye_MajorCustomerNumberOneMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_reM9hIr_s0mROwVm3Xh6nA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" id="Narr_LeVl0VZ_pEyCwtJwie35RQ">12</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Bw5QC5McPUa3s352AniCXg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_aeye_MajorCustomerNumberOneMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_ciPut95wLEaDOzYbqbLtxw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" id="Narr_Vpr57XfxlkCxiFofYJZYPA">14</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively, of total accounts receivable as of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and 2024.</p></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_GWJI_GDVXkqDEu1UVT4TKQ" name="us-gaap:DeferredChargesPolicyTextBlock" id="Tb_n0B5yU4cGEq5MU9BVNXa6w" continuedAt="Tb_n0B5yU4cGEq5MU9BVNXa6w_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;">Deferred Costs (Contract Acquisition Costs)</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">We capitalize initial and renewal sales commissions in the period the commission is earned, which generally occurs when a customer contract is obtained, and amortize deferred commission costs on a straight-line basis over the expected period of benefit, which we have deemed to be the contract term. As a practical expedient, we expense sales commissions as incurred when the amortization period of related deferred commission costs would have been one year or less.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The table below summarizes the deferred commission costs as of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and 2024,&#160;which are included in Prepaid expenses and other current assets (current portion) and Other assets (noncurrent portion) on our consolidated balance sheets:<span style="font-size:12pt;"> </span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_GWJI_GDVXkqDEu1UVT4TKQ" name="us-gaap:DeferredPolicyAcquisitionCostsTableTextBlock" id="Tb_4CR7GiUBIE2xpswPHpeFtw" continuedAt="Tb_4CR7GiUBIE2xpswPHpeFtw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="text-transform:uppercase;">F-</span><span style="text-transform:uppercase;">8</span></p></div></div>
